---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CloudPress - 통합 클라우드 호스팅 플랫폼">
  <div class="text-center py-20">
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
      통합 클라우드 호스팅의 새로운 기준
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
      컨테이너, 데이터베이스, 스토리지, 도메인, AI까지. 
      CloudPress 하나로 모든 인프라를 관리하세요.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a href="/dashboard" class="bg-primary hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors">
        무료로 시작하기
      </a>
      <a href="#features" class="border-2 border-primary text-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors">
        기능 살펴보기
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="features" class="py-20">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">CCS 컨테이너</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Cloudflare Containers 기반 경량 가상화. 초단위 스케일링, 사용한 만큼만 과금.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">ClouDB 데이터베이스</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">MariaDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite 지원. 자동 백업, HA 구성, 읽기 복제본.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Cloudage 스토리지</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">R2 기반 객체 스토리지. 자동 압축, 중복 제거, IA 계층화로 비용 최대 80% 절감.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
